    "xiv, 161 p. : 26 cm",
    "Functional practicing / Kenny Aronoff -- Inspired practice / Anders Astrand -- An appetizing rehearsal / John H. Beck -- Southern Italian tambourine pizzica / Alessandra Belloni -- Playing with other instruments / Ivana Bilic -- Creative music-making and the drumset player / Bob Breithaupt -- Feeding the imagination / Bill Bruford -- Interpretation and expression / Michael Burritt -- Cooking in time / Bill Cahn -- For a great performance, follow all the directions / Jeff Calissi -- Teaching young percussionists to make musical choices / James Campbell -- Exploring interpretation through percussion notation / Anthony J. Cirone -- Making it to the top / F. Michael Combs -- Avoiding mental masonry / Christopher Deane -- Tasty charts for the drumline / Dennis Delucia -- Savoring the sounds / Robin Engelman -- Ride cymbal a la mode / Peter Erskine -- Vocabulary crock pot stew / Neal Flum -- Finding musical expression in marimba performance / Mark Ford -- Snare drum gumbo / Guy G. Gauthreaux II -- Successful time playing in a jazz combo / Danny Gottlieb -- It's time / Gordon Gottlieb -- The elusive \"closed'' snare drum roll / Neil Grover -- Cooking up a world percussion ensemble / Julie Hill -- A healthy marimba breakfast / Rich Holly -- Creative practice / Steve Houghton -- Layering in a rhythm cake / Arthur Hull -- Teacher as student as teacher / Kalani -- A multiple-percussion approach to drumset / Glenn Kotche -- Making your compass / Lalo -- Good drum circles are not just \"pot luck'' / Rick Mattingly -- A good practice session should be like a four-course meal / William Moersch -- Focused, result-oriented practice sessions / Jeff Moore -- Improving time feel / Rod Morgenstein -- A tasty alternative for the light practice schedule / Valerie Dee Naranjo -- Junk food / Mark Nauseef -- Analytical listening / Terry O'Mahoney -- A deeper groove / Jim Payne -- Teaching a fast learner / Al Payson -- How to get good / Jeff Queen -- Feeding difficult students / John Riley -- It's all about the basics / Lisa Rogers -- Recipe for an orchestral percussion audition / Michael Rosen -- A creative recipe for the improvising vibist / Ed Saindon -- A well-rounded approach to musical growth / Dave Samuels -- Recipe for chart reading / Casey Scheuerell -- A tasteful concert bass drum / James A. Sewrey -- Drumset balance / Ed Shaughnessy -- If you can sing it you can play it / Kristen Shiner McGuire -- Developing a unique voice / Dick Sisto -- Practicing and playing the drumset / Ed Soph -- Improved snare drum solo scores / Gary Stith -- What are you prepared to do? / John Tafoya -- Private lessons for the beginner / Garwood Whaley -- Frame drum chops with spicy rudimental marinade / B. Michael Williams -- Recipe for a thinking musician / She Wu -- A recipe for success! / Zoro"
